{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    " 和 ": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": " and "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@\n\n这通常发生在更新之后，重新安装后台 Helper 即可修复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@\n\nThis usually happens after an update. Reinstalling the background helper fixes it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 分钟": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 小时": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld hr"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld%%": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 小时": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 hour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Helper 已安装 · 合盖档可用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Helper installed · Lid tier available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "License 无效——请检查是否完整粘贴。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invalid license — check that you pasted it in full."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 正在过热，暂时无法保持唤醒，待冷却后再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mac is running hot — keep-awake can't start right now. Try again once it cools down."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 正在过热，请留意散热。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Mac is running hot — check its cooling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 过热或电量过低时自动暂停，无人值守也安全。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pauses automatically when the Mac runs hot or the battery runs low — safe when unattended."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NightCat 退出或崩溃时，看门狗会自动恢复正常睡眠，Mac 不会卡在保持唤醒状态。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If NightCat quits or crashes, a watchdog restores normal sleep automatically — the Mac can't get stuck awake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "、": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ", "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「仅插电时保持」已开启，请连接电源后再保持唤醒。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Keep only while charging” is on — connect the charger before keeping awake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一切就绪": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All set"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一步": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Never"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不限时": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No limit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "严重过热": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Critical"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅插电时保持": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep only while charging"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅通知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notify only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "低电量阈值": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Low-battery threshold"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保持唤醒已在 NightCat 之外被关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep-awake was turned off outside NightCat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保持唤醒已在 NightCat 之外被开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep-awake was turned on outside NightCat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保持唤醒被其他程序关闭，自动恢复失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep-awake was turned off by another program, and the restore failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保持唤醒被其他程序反复关闭，已停止自动恢复。请检查远程软件等工具的电源设置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep-awake was repeatedly turned off by another program; auto-restore has stopped. Check the power settings of remote-desktop tools."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "偏热": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Warm"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充电时自动开启合盖档": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on the Lid tier when charging"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "免去密码弹窗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No more password prompts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭购买提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dismiss the purchase hint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分钟（1–240）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Minutes (1–240)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换并解除锁定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch and Unlock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前往登录项批准": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Approve in Login Items"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可选——不安装也能用，只是每次切换档位时会询问密码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Optional — without it, everything still works; switching tiers just asks for a password each time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合上盖子带走 Mac 时，编码代理、下载和构建仍可继续运行。系统自带的 `caffeinate` 做不到这一点——NightCat 可以。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coding agents, downloads, and builds keep running while the Mac travels with its lid closed. The built-in `caffeinate` can't do that — NightCat can."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合上盖子继续运行 · 需要特权 Helper": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep running with the lid closed · requires the privileged helper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合盖": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lid"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "合盖不睡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lid Closed Awake"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台 Helper": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Background Helper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台 Helper 已启用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Background helper enabled"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台 Helper 已安装并运行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The background helper is installed and running."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台 Helper 已重新安装——请重试切换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The background helper has been reinstalled — try the switch again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "后台 Helper 未响应。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The background helper isn't responding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动恢复合盖档已开启，但「登录时启动」已关闭——重启后 NightCat 不会自启，合盖机器将无法远程唤醒。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Launch restore is on, but Launch at Login is off — after a reboot NightCat won't start, and a lid-closed Mac can't be reached."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动时恢复合盖档": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore the Lid tier at launch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "喜欢 NightCat？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enjoying NightCat?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果它陪你跑通过通宵，请它喝杯咖啡吧。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If it has seen you through an all-nighter, buy it a coffee."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安全": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Safety"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装一个很小的后台 Helper，开关保持唤醒时便不再询问管理员密码，安全看门狗也随之可用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install a tiny background helper: switching keep-awake no longer asks for an admin password, and the safety watchdog becomes available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装后切换档位不再询问管理员密码，并启用安全看门狗。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install once: switching tiers no longer asks for an admin password, and the safety watchdog turns on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装后台 Helper": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install Background Helper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "定时关闭": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-Off Timer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "定时已到，保持唤醒已关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time's up; keep-awake is off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "定时已到：已按 %@ 自动关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time's up: keep-awake was turned off (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "定时开始时锁定档位": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lock the tier when a timer starts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "屏幕保持点亮 · 系统仍可睡眠": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Display stays lit · the system may still sleep"
