          }
        }
      }
    },
    "改用防空闲": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use No Idle instead"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无 Helper 连接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No helper connection"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法保持 Mac 唤醒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't keep the Mac awake"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法关闭保持唤醒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't turn keep-awake off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法向系统确认保持唤醒已生效——合盖后可能不会保持唤醒。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't confirm with the system that keep-awake took effect — the Mac may not stay awake with the lid closed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法确认睡眠已恢复——Mac 可能仍处于保持唤醒。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't confirm that sleep was restored — the Mac may still be held awake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法连接 Gumroad，请检查网络后重试。首次激活需要联网。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn't reach Gumroad — check your network and try again. First activation needs internet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无法连接后台 Helper": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can't reach the background helper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更改未生效——系统显示保持唤醒仍处于开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The change didn't take effect — the system reports keep-awake still on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "更改未生效——系统显示保持唤醒已关闭。": {
